# Secrets. The documented workflow is `vercel env pull` (see CLAUDE.md
# "Commands"), which writes **.env.local** — NOT `.env`. The single `.env`
# line this file used to carry did not match that filename, so a pulled
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY / SUPABASE_SERVICE_KEY / STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET /
# VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY was one `git add .` away from being committed.
# `.env*` covers .env, .env.local, .env.production.local, and friends.
.env
.env*
.env*.local
# ...but keep a checked-in template visible if one is ever added.
!.env.example

.DS_Store
node_modules/
.vercel
.next/

# Installed plugin copies — source of truth is golsz-guard/
.claude/plugins/
